5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I'm looking forward to working with you all to find a program that truly supports our patients and staff in a sustainable way.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure. I believe we should be cautious and look at the actual outcomes of our previous efforts before committing to something new.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We need to be realistic about who is actually going to do the work on the ground.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,A pragmatic approach is best. I want to ensure that whatever we select is financially viable and doesn't become a burden later.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I just hope we can find something that fits comfortably into our daily routines without causing too much stress for the hospital.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'm worried about programs that look good on paper but fail because the partners aren't fully committed. I'll check the board minutes on a jointly run clinic.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'll look into the readmission figures during the call-back trial. I want to see if these types of initiatives actually move the needle for patients.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll examine the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, and the therapy and midwifery staffing review. We need to know where the gaps are.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'll be looking at this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location. The numbers must make sense.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I think I will look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records. We must be sure there is space for people.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll also look at the visit completion on the shared nursing round to see how external visits actually fared.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'll add the data agreements with outside surgeries to my list. Coordination often fails at the administrative level.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
